<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS2" title="In Appendix C Shuffling Algorithms ‣ Cross-Modal Taxonomic Generalization in (Vision-) Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.2 </span>Within-category Shuffle</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
