<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Shuffling Algorithms</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This appendix provides detailed descriptions of the algorithms used to create the counterfactual datasets.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.1 </span>Across-category Shuffle</h3>

<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithm <a href="#algorithm1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ C.1 Across-category Shuffle ‣ Appendix C Shuffling Algorithms ‣ Cross-Modal Taxonomic Generalization in (Vision-) Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> describes the procedure for creating the across-category shuffle, which randomly maps original leaf-level concepts to new leaf-level concepts, regardless of their hypernym categories.</p>
</div>
<figure id="algorithm1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span>Across-category Shuffle</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm1.4.1" class="ltx_listingline">
<span id="algorithm1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span><math id="algorithm1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}</annotation></semantics></math>: hypernym-to-leaf mapping
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.2.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> </span><math id="algorithm1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math>: concept-to-concept shuffle mapping
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Function</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.3.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_typewriter">ShuffleConcepts(<em id="algorithm1.4.3.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_serif ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}</annotation></semantics></math></em>)</em><span id="algorithm1.4.3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">:</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.4" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.5" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">foreach</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.5.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">leaf list <math id="algorithm1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}\in\mathrm{values}(\mathcal{H})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi>values</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}\in\mathrm{values}(\mathcal{H})</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.4.5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.6" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}\leftarrow\mathcal{C}\cup\mathcal{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mo>∪</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}\leftarrow\mathcal{C}\cup\mathcal{L}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.7" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{\text{shuffled}}\leftarrow\text{RandomShuffle}(\mathcal{C})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mtext>shuffled</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>RandomShuffle</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{\text{shuffled}}\leftarrow\text{RandomShuffle}(\mathcal{C})</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.8" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.9" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.4.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.9.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.4.9.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_upright">to</span> <math id="algorithm1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\mathcal{C}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\mathcal{C}|</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.4.9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.10" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}[\mathcal{C}[i]]\leftarrow\mathcal{C}_{\text{shuffled}}[i]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mtext>shuffled</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}[\mathcal{C}[i]]\leftarrow\mathcal{C}_{\text{shuffled}}[i]</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.11" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.4.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.11.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math></em>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.12" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Within-category Shuffle</h3>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithm <a href="#algorithm2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ C.2 Within-category Shuffle ‣ Appendix C Shuffling Algorithms ‣ Cross-Modal Taxonomic Generalization in (Vision-) Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> describes the procedure for creating the within-category shuffle, which reassigns concepts to images within the same category while ensuring no concept maps to itself.</p>
</div>
<figure id="algorithm2" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span>Within-category Shuffle</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm2.4.1" class="ltx_listingline">
<span id="algorithm2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span><math id="algorithm2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}</annotation></semantics></math>: hypernym-to-concepts mapping
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.2.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> </span><math id="algorithm2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math>: concept-to-concept shuffle mapping
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Function</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.3.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_typewriter">ShuffleWithinCategory(<em id="algorithm2.4.3.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_serif ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}</annotation></semantics></math></em>)</em><span id="algorithm2.4.3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">:</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.4" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm2.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm2.4.4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Build concept-to-hypernyms mapping </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.5" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.6" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm2.4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">foreach</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.6.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">hypernym <math id="algorithm2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math>, concepts <math id="algorithm2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{h}\in\mathcal{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{h}\in\mathcal{H}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.7" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm2.4.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">foreach</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.7.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">concept <math id="algorithm2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c\in\mathcal{C}_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c\in\mathcal{C}_{h}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.8" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}[c]\leftarrow\mathcal{L}[c]\cup\{h\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}[c]\leftarrow\mathcal{L}[c]\cup\{h\}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.9" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm2.4.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm2.4.9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Group concepts by their hypernym sets </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.10" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{G}\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{G}\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.11" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm2.4.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">foreach</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.11.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">concept <math id="algorithm2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math>, hypernyms <math id="algorithm2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{c}\in\mathcal{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}_{c}\in\mathcal{L}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.12" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{G}[\text{frozenset}(\mathcal{H}_{c})]\leftarrow\mathcal{G}[\text{frozenset}(\mathcal{H}_{c})]\cup\{c\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mtext>frozenset</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mtext>frozenset</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{G}[\text{frozenset}(\mathcal{H}_{c})]\leftarrow\mathcal{G}[\text{frozenset}(\mathcal{H}_{c})]\cup\{c\}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.13" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm2.4.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm2.4.13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Shuffle within each group </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.14" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm2.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.15" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm2.4.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">foreach</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.15.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">group key <math id="algorithm2.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>, concepts <math id="algorithm2.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{k}\in\mathcal{G}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{k}\in\mathcal{G}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.16" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm2.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{\text{shuffled}}\leftarrow\text{RandomShuffle}(\mathcal{C}_{k})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mtext>shuffled</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>RandomShuffle</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{\text{shuffled}}\leftarrow\text{RandomShuffle}(\mathcal{C}_{k})</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.17" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm2.4.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.17.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm2.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm2.4.17.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_upright">to</span> <math id="algorithm2.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\mathcal{C}_{k}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\mathcal{C}_{k}|</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.18" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm2.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}[\mathcal{C}_{k}[i]]\leftarrow\mathcal{C}_{\text{shuffled}}[i]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mtext>shuffled</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}[\mathcal{C}_{k}[i]]\leftarrow\mathcal{C}_{\text{shuffled}}[i]</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.19" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm2.4.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.19.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm2.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math></em>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.20" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Results on Llama 3.2 Models</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we report results from our experiments on Llama-3.2-1B and its instruction-tuned variant Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib67" title="" class="ltx_ref">Grattafiori et al., 2024</a>)</cite>. <a href="#A4.F10" title="In Appendix D Results on Llama 3.2 Models ‣ Cross-Modal Taxonomic Generalization in (Vision-) Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> shows results of our main experiment on the Llama 3.2 models, and <a href="#A4.F11" title="In Appendix D Results on Llama 3.2 Models ‣ Cross-Modal Taxonomic Generalization in (Vision-) Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> shows results on our counterfactual experiments for these models.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.F10" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2603.07474v1/main-exp-results-llama.svg" id="A4.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/248;" width="476" height="248"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>Macro F1s of Llama 3.2 models on unseen images across LM backbones, LM representations (pre-trained vs. random), and hypernym ablation type (Random vs. Systematic) at different amounts of exposure to hypernym categories, for various test splits. Dashed line indicates macro F1 of the majority-label baseline. Error bands represent 95% confidence intervals across random seeds (<math id="A4.F10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> = 3) and categories (hypernyms = 53, leaves = 1216). </figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A4.F11" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2603.07474v1/counterfactual-shuffling-results-generalization-llama.svg" id="A4.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:333/226;" width="333" height="226"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span>Macro F1s of Llama 3.2 models trained on data with different counterfactual shuffles (or lack thereof) at predicting hypernyms, across various amounts of exposure to hypernym categories. Dashed line indicates macro F1 of the majority-label baseline. Error bands show 95% confidence intervals for three random seeds and 53 hypernym categories.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Results on Qwen3-8B LM backbone</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A5.T5" title="In Appendix E Results on Qwen3-8B LM backbone ‣ Cross-Modal Taxonomic Generalization in (Vision-) Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> shows results from the 100% ablation experiments across various counterfactual shuffles, using the Qwen3-8B model as the LM backbone. We see similar results as with smaller models in the main paper—results on Original and Within-category shuffles are similar while those on Across-category shuffle are vastly different (and lower). This suggests that arbitrary reasoning about hypernymy does not emerge in this larger model, and that it is still sensitive to the visual coherence of categories in the incoming input.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.T5" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A5.T5.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
